AI search engines (Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Perplexity) are changing how people find information. Most SEO tools still focus on traditional Google rankings, but **citation in AI answers = visibility**. This project fills that gap. so basically, Build SEO optimization tool (like ClickRank) that analyzes content for AI search visibility (Google AI Overviews, ChatGPT, Gemini citations). Analyze websites for "AI Search Readiness" based on local HTML signals (Schema, Structure, E-E-A-T), utilizing Jina.ai for scraping and Gemini for generating fixes.

### **What Is It?**
An AI-powered SEO optimization tool that:
1. Monitors when your website gets cited in AI search results
2. Analyzes content structure/metadata for AI readiness
3. Generates one-click fixes (schema markup, optimization code)
4. Tracks competitor citations and competitive positioning

